":"Euro House","n":1}],"labels":[],"album_labels":[],"own_scenes":[],"scenes":[{"id":132218155550361,"name":"Techno y trance de los noventa","book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","start":1990,"end":2001,"desc":"El techno y el house tardan una década en dominar el baile, pero luego se extienden como la pólvora y la diferencia entre ambos se difumina. Bélgica (Lords Of Acid), Francia (Laurent Garnier), Japón (Ken Ishii); Alemania tiene la escena más variada: Sven Väth inventa el trance de Frankfurt, Air Liquide el techno psicodélico de Colonia, La Bouche, L@n. Jimi Tenor, Ace Of Base, Aqua; en Australia, David Thrussell (Snog, Black Lung, Soma). EE UU, cuna del techno, es derivativo: Deee-Lite, Crystal Method, Jeff Mills (Underground Resistance), BT (el «epic house»), Wod, y San Francisco con su psicodelia electrónica (Hardkiss, Freaky Chakra). En Gran Bretaña, EMF, Utah Saints, Carter USM y el «Goa trance» de Paul Oakenfold (Paul Van Dyk, ATB).","color":"#facc15","family":"Soul, funk, disco, hip hop y baile","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#techno-90s"},{"id":207220859413679,"name":"Trance holandés","book":"Loops 1 y 2. Una historia de la música electrónica","author":"Javier Blánquez (ed.)","start":1999,"end":2010,"desc":"Los DJs holandeses toman al asalto el trance maximizando la euforia y la conexión emocional con melodías facilonas y efectos primarios.","color":"#22d3ee","family":"Techno y derivados","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/loops_timeline/#trance-holandes"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":169670619965060,"artist":"ATB","artist_id":6255271587400,"title":"9 PM (Till I Come)","year":1998,"ess":0,"yt":"QFGMQZyvnmY","kind":null,"book":{"id":10,"title":"Loops 1 y 2. Una historia de la música electrónica","author":"Javier Blánquez (ed.)","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/loops_timeline/"},"scene":"Trance holandés","scene_id":207220859413679,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/loops_timeline/#trance-holandes","chapters"